# `chat.state`

Recent messages for the chat drawer, scoped by workspace.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.chat.read`. ⚠️ sensitive — payload may carry secrets or git content.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `workspace_id` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

